Introduction to Algebra,10,"Communicate your learning; Begin the year by understanding variables, expressions, and problem-solving strategies.","CCSS.MATH.CONTENT.HSA.SSE.A.1, CCSS.MATH.CONTENT.HSA.SSE.B.3"
