Functions and Graphs,12,Understand what functions are and how to graph them; Interpret graphs in context.,"CCSS.MATH.CONTENT.HSF.IF.A.1, CCSS.MATH.CONTENT.HSF.IF.C.7"
Systems of Equations and Inequalities,10,Solve systems of equations both graphically and algebraically; Interpret solutions in context.,"CCSS.MATH.CONTENT.HSA.REI.C.5, CCSS.MATH.CONTENT.HSA.REI.C.6"
